{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Town Management Game with a Twist . . .</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a fun approach to town management games that puts you in a leadership position while giving you a tough moral compass. Will you take the consequences of being a vampire to appease the people of your town? Will you anger your people for few extra drops of blood?\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Reputation Matters . . .</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your people are not stupid and will often react dramatically different to your responses, depending on your current standings in the town. Pay attention to what people are asking for, and plan accordingly based on your social standing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Collection of Storylines . . .</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you manage your town, the working members  will come daily with updates to their own possible stories. These stories have many branching paths and can result in vastly different outcomes. What advantages or hinderances will come from these special requests?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4009010?t=1758621138","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4009010?t=1758621138","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009010/0d0d873aadd7afe1572f79627273c5666b42848f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758621138","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009010/0d0d873aadd7afe1572f79627273c5666b42848f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758621138","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"It is very non-realistic fantasy crime that happens to imply mature topics at times."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Town Management Game with a Twist . . .</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a fun approach to town management games that puts you in a leadership position while giving you a tough moral compass. Will you take the consequences of being a vampire to appease the people of your town? Will you anger your people for few extra drops of blood?\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Reputation Matters . . .</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your people are not stupid and will often react dramatically different to your responses, depending on your current standings in the town. Pay attention to what people are asking for, and plan accordingly based on your social standing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Collection of Storylines . . .</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you manage your town, the working members  will come daily with updates to their own possible stories. These stories have many branching paths and can result in vastly different outcomes. What advantages or hinderances will come from these special requests?</p>","developers":["Midnight Mess"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009010/ebf260a78d6838e31d07e2a150f1e507b7573662/header.jpg?t=1758621138","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4009010/1749460522/69f029dc6e1087ac491bbd9057f4cd867aa58049/1758158645/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758621136","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4009010/1749460522/69f029dc6e1087ac491bbd9057f4cd867aa58049/1758158645/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758621136","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4009010/1749460522/69f029dc6e1087ac491bbd9057f4cd867aa58049/1758158645/hls_264_